---
// Marca: escada de três degraus (gradatim = passo a passo) num círculo âmbar.
---

<span class="logo">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" width="32" height="32" aria-hidden="true">
    <circle cx="16" cy="16" r="16" fill="#F0B93B"></circle>
    <path d="M8 23h5v-5h5v-5h5V9" fill="none" stroke="#12302B" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
  </svg>
  <span class="logo-name">gradatim</span>
</span>

<style>
  .logo {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .logo-name {
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.375rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1;
  }
</style>
